      "version": 2,
      "verifies": [
        "FANDAWS v2.1 Rule VD-6 \u2014 BFO version change invalidates placements"
      ],
      "description": "When BFO is re-ingested (simulating a version change), all prior Phase 1 placement decisions are auto-re-evaluated by the sandbox using the new BFO hierarchy. Classes whose confidence remains \u22650.7 stay canonical (with placementChanged flag if placement moved). Classes dropping below 0.7 go to PendingHumanResolution. v2: updated per SME clarification \u2014 auto-re-evaluation, not blanket invalidation.",
